{"id":"sh/1cvuxc7e","kind":"textbox","name":"矩形 19","position":{"left":120,"top":1690,"width":1840,"height":64},"text":"图1  端到端时域掩蔽流程：编码器提取特征，TCN估计掩蔽，共享解码器重建两个源信号。","style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#5F6368","alignment":"center"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/0bmd476t","kind":"textbox","name":"矩形 20","position":{"left":2040,"top":1690,"width":1010,"height":64},"text":"图2  多尺度结构：三种时间尺度并行编码，融合后由TCN分离，再经对应尺度解码。","style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#5F6368","alignment":"center"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/zadcv2p8","kind":"textbox","name":"矩形 21","position":{"left":140,"top":1770,"width":2898.58,"height":145},"text":"结构比较：基线、深层、多尺度和组合模型只改变编码器与解码器，TCN分离器保持一致。\n实验数据：WSJ0-2mix语音；BPSK、QPSK和16QAM合成通信信号，含频偏、相偏及10–30 dB高斯白噪声。\n训练与指标：排列不变训练与负SI-SNR损失；语音报告SI-SNR、PESQ，通信同时报告SI-SNR、BER。","style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#202124","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/e94v2hon","kind":"textbox","name":"矩形 22","position":{"left":120,"top":1960,"width":2938.58,"height":70},"text":"结果与讨论","style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#C8161E","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
